<article id="post-8616" class="post-8616 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-canadian-securities-exchange-magazine tag-cse-issuer-stories tag-csemilk tag-plant-veda-foods">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/plant-veda-foods-with-its-plant-based-dairy-products-flying-off-shelves-this-conscientious-companys-business-outlook-is-soaring-too/" aria-hidden="true">
