<article id="post-8389" class="post-8389 post type-post status-publish format-standard has-post-thumbnail hentry category-cse-issuer-stories category-cse-magazine tag-2021-issue-2 tag-bright-minds-biosciences-csedrug tag-cse-magazine tag-entheon-biomedical-cseenbi tag-mindset-pharma-csemset tag-revitalist-lifestyle-and-wellness-csecalm tag-wesana-health-holdings-csewesa">
	
	<a class="post-thumbnail" href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-psychedelics-issue-now-live/" aria-hidden="true">
	<img width="672" height="372" src="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1-672x372.jpg" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Psychedelics Issue – Now Live!" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1-672x372.jpg 672w, https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1-1038x576.jpg 1038w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px" data-attachment-id="8391" data-permalink="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-psychedelics-issue-now-live/cse_2021-issue-2_new-issue_blog-header-1/" data-orig-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1.jpg" data-orig-size="1920,1080" data-comments-opened="0" data-image-title="CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header (1)" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://blog.thecse.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/11/CSE_2021-Issue-2_New-Issue_Blog-Header-1-1024x576.jpg" />	</a>

	
	<header class="entry-header">
				<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="cat-links"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-issuer-stories/" rel="category tag">CSE Issuer Stories</a>, <a href="https://blog.thecse.com/category/cse-magazine/" rel="category tag">Magazine</a></span>
		</div>
		<h1 class="entry-title"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-psychedelics-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine: The Psychedelics Issue – Now Live!</a></h1>
		<div class="entry-meta">
			<span class="entry-date"><a href="https://blog.thecse.com/canadian-securities-exchange-magazine-the-psychedelics-issue-now-live/" rel="bookmark"><time class="entry-date" datetime="2021-11-25T09:30:21-05:00">November 25, 2021</time></a></span> <span class="byline"><span class="author vcard"><a class="url fn n" href="https://blog.thecse.com/author/administrator/" rel="author">CSE Blogger</a></span></span>		</div><!-- .entry-meta -->
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

		<div class="entry-content">
		<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Welcome to the latest issue of the </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, your source for in-depth stories of entrepreneurs from a wealth of different industries.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Psychedelics has emerged as a rapidly-evolving industry in the last few years. In this issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazine</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">, we&#8217;re thrilled to share stories of visionary entrepreneurs in this sector.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">We shine a spotlight on five publicly-listed psychedelics companies on the CSE who are looking back to older medicines in order to move forward, and developing innovative treatments designed to achieve better health outcomes for people experiencing mental health conditions, chronic pain, addiction, and more.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The CSE-listed companies featured in this issue include:</span></p>
<ul>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Revitalist Lifestyle and Wellness (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/revitalist-lifestyle-and-wellness-ltd"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:CALM</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Entheon Biomedical (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/entheon-biomedical-corp"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:ENBI</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Bright Minds Biosciences (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/bright-minds-biosciences-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:DRUG</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Wesana Health Holdings (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/wesana-health-holdings-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:WESA</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
<li style="font-weight: 400;" aria-level="1"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Mindset Pharma (</span><a href="https://thecse.com/en/listings/life-sciences/mindset-pharma-inc"><span style="font-weight: 400;">CSE:MSET</span></a><span style="font-weight: 400;">)</span></li>
</ul>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Check out the Psychedelics Issue of </span><i><span style="font-weight: 400;">Canadian Securities Exchange Magazin</span></i><span style="font-weight: 400;">e here:</span></p>
